      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SECATEUR (1) racing well without winning and has a strong place strike-rate, with nine minors from nine starts. Is racing in consistent form without winning, hitting the frame at the last nine starts. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Well placed and gets his chance. CHASE MAC (7) held his own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only a nose (30.40) behind Ruby Mac at this track. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Expected to feature. SLIM SIA (5) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at this track following on from a third place finish (30.71) there the start prior. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. One of the better hopes. KYLIE MOLE (4) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
